{"entries":[{"id":"feifei-2409.01652","sourceId":"feifei","sourceName":"李飞飞","title":"ReKep: Spatio-Temporal Reasoning of Relational Keypoint Constraints for Robotic Manipulation","titleZh":"ReKep：用于机器人操作的关系关键点约束的时空推理","published":"2024-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1725321600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/feifei-2409.01652/","image":"","summary":"ReKep represents manipulation tasks as sequences of relational keypoint constraints, enabling real-time hierarchical optimization and automated constraint generation from language and vision.","summaryZh":"ReKep 将操作任务表示为关系关键点约束序列，支持实时分层优化，并能从语言和视觉中自动生成约束。"},{"id":"feifei-2307.05973","sourceId":"feifei","sourceName":"李飞飞 · Stanford","title":"VoxPoser: Composable 3D Value Maps for Robotic Manipulation with Language Models","titleZh":"VoxPoser：基于语言模型的可组合 3D 价值图用于机器人操作","published":"2023-07-12T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1689120000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/feifei-2307.05973/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/d26c0002c4d42d41.webp","summary":"LLMs and VLMs compose 3D value maps to zero-shot synthesize robot trajectories for diverse manipulation tasks.","summaryZh":"利用大语言模型和视觉语言模型构建 3D 价值图，零样本合成机器人轨迹，完成多种操作任务。"},{"id":"feifei-1602.07332","sourceId":"feifei","sourceName":"李飞飞 · Stanford","title":"Visual Genome: Connecting Language and Vision Using Crowdsourced Dense Image Annotations","titleZh":"Visual Genome：利用众包密集图像标注连接语言与视觉","published":"2016-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1456185600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/feifei-1602.07332/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/1e31045b035b43e9.webp","summary":"We present Visual Genome, a dataset with over 100K images densely annotated with objects, attributes, and relationships to enable cognitive tasks like image description and question answering.","summaryZh":"我们提出了 Visual Genome 数据集，包含超过 10 万张图像，每张图像平均有 21 个物体、18 个属性和 18 个物体间关系，旨在支持图像描述和问答等认知任务。"},{"id":"feifei-1409.0575","sourceId":"feifei","sourceName":"李飞飞 · Stanford","tit